# 锁定文本文件行尾,保证容器密封链(scripts/seal_container.py 算 src 树 SHA-256)
# 在 Windows 构建、Linux 运行时不因 CRLF/LF 差异产生哈希假阳性(reviewer A3)。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换
*.pth binary
*.pt binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.dcm binary
*.torchscript.pt binary
